    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLY/SOUTHWEST\nAIRLINES®\nSeptember 8, 1989 Flight Schedule\nThe\nCompany\nPlane:\nis on call.\nNew Signals\nOf Success",
      "FLY/SOUTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nPacific\nMountain\nCentral\nEastern\n(City \u0026 Metro)\nChicago,\nMidway\nOakland\nSan Francisco\nLos Angeles\n(LAX)\n-Ontario\nSan Diego\nPhoenix\nAmarillo\nLubbock\nMidland/\nOdessa\nEl Paso\nPhoenix and Indianapolis do not observe\nDaylight Savings Time.\nOklahoma\nCity\nSan Antonio\nCorpus\nChristi\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nLittle Rock\nDallas\n(Love Field)\nHouston\n(Hobby \u0026 Intercontinental)\nRio Grande Valley\n(Harlingen/South Padre Island)\nNashville\nBirmingham\nNew Orleans\nIf you fly frequently on Southwest Airlines,\nplease send us your name and address and we\nwill place you on our mailing list. Mail\nrequests to: Southwest Airlines Schedule List\nPO. Box 650331\nDallas, TX 75265-0331\n© 1989 Southwest Airlines\nAll other correspondence should be sent to:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.\nP.O. Box 37611\nDallas, TX 75235"
    ],
